.SS "yabai display"
.PP
\fByabai display\fR [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-display\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.PP
Focus, label or show a space on a display
.PP
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-display\fR \fI<DISPLAY_SEL>\fR
Act on this display instead of the one showing the active menu bar
.SS "yabai display focus"
.PP
\fByabai display focus\fR <\fIDISPLAY_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Focus another display; relative selectors start from the acting display
.SS "yabai display show-space"
.PP
\fByabai display show\-space\fR <\fISPACE_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Show a space of the acting display there without focusing it (needs the scripting addition)
.SS "yabai display label"
.PP
\fByabai display label\fR [\fILABEL\fR] 
.PP
Label the acting display; without LABEL, remove its label
.PP
.TP
[\fILABEL\fR]
Any text a display selector would not read as something else
.SS "yabai space"
.PP
\fByabai space\fR [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-space\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.PP
Focus, create, move, re\-tile or label a space
.PP
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-space\fR \fI<SPACE_SEL>\fR
Act on this space instead of the focused one
.SS "yabai space focus"
.PP
\fByabai space focus\fR <\fISPACE_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Focus a space where it is; relative selectors start from the acting space
.SS "yabai space switch"
.PP
\fByabai space switch\fR <\fISPACE_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Bring a space to the focused display and focus it; relative selectors start from the acting space
.SS "yabai space create"
.PP
\fByabai space create\fR [\fIDISPLAY_SEL\fR] 
.PP
Create a space on a display [default: the display of the acting space]
.SS "yabai space destroy"
.PP
Destroy the acting space
.SS "yabai space move"
.PP
\fByabai space move\fR <\fISPACE_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Move the acting space to the position of another space of its display
.SS "yabai space swap"
.PP
\fByabai space swap\fR <\fISPACE_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Swap the acting space with another space
.SS "yabai space send-to-display"
.PP
\fByabai space send\-to\-display\fR <\fIDISPLAY_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Send the acting space to another display
.SS "yabai space equalize"
.PP
\fByabai space equalize\fR [\fIAXIS\fR] 
.PP
Reset every split of the acting space to the global split ratio [default: along both axes]
.PP
.TP
[\fIAXIS\fR]
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
x\-axis
.IP \(bu 2
y\-axis
.RE
.SS "yabai space balance"
.PP
\fByabai space balance\fR [\fIAXIS\fR] 
.PP
Give every window of the acting space an equal share [default: along both axes]
.PP
.TP
[\fIAXIS\fR]
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
x\-axis
.IP \(bu 2
y\-axis
.RE
.SS "yabai space mirror"
.PP
\fByabai space mirror\fR <\fIAXIS\fR> 
.PP
Flip the tree of the acting space along an axis
.PP
.TP
<\fIAXIS\fR>
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
x\-axis
.IP \(bu 2
y\-axis
.RE
.SS "yabai space rotate"
.PP
\fByabai space rotate\fR <\fIDEGREES\fR> 
.PP
Rotate the tree of the acting space clockwise
.PP
.TP
<\fIDEGREES\fR>
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
90
.IP \(bu 2
180
.IP \(bu 2
270
.RE
.SS "yabai space padding"
.PP
\fByabai space padding\fR <\fICHANGE\fR> <\fITOP\fR> <\fIBOTTOM\fR> <\fILEFT\fR> <\fIRIGHT\fR> 
.PP
Set or change the padding of the acting space, in points
.PP
.TP
<\fICHANGE\fR>
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
to: Set the value
.IP \(bu 2
by: Add to the current value
.RE
.SS "yabai space gap"
.PP
\fByabai space gap\fR <\fICHANGE\fR> <\fIGAP\fR> 
.PP
Set or change the gap between the windows of the acting space, in points
.PP
.TP
<\fICHANGE\fR>
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
to: Set the value
.IP \(bu 2
by: Add to the current value
.RE
.SS "yabai space toggle"
.PP
\fByabai space toggle\fR <\fISETTING\fR> 
.PP
Toggle the padding or the gap of the acting space, or focus it and toggle mission control or show desktop
.PP
.TP
<\fISETTING\fR>
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
padding
.IP \(bu 2
gap
.IP \(bu 2
mission\-control
.IP \(bu 2
show\-desktop
.RE
.SS "yabai space layout"
.PP
\fByabai space layout\fR <\fILAYOUT\fR> 
.PP
Re\-tile the acting space; unlike `config set \-\-space`, a later global layout replaces it
.PP
.TP
<\fILAYOUT\fR>
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bsp
.IP \(bu 2
stack
.IP \(bu 2
float
.RE
.SS "yabai space label"
.PP
\fByabai space label\fR [\fILABEL\fR] 
.PP
Label the acting space; without LABEL, remove its label
.PP
.TP
[\fILABEL\fR]
Any text a space selector would not read as something else
.SS "yabai window"
.PP
\fByabai window\fR [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-window\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.PP
Focus, move, resize, tile or toggle a window
.PP
Relative selectors in the arguments of an action (west, next, stack.next…) start from the acting window.
.PP
.TP
\fB\-w\fR, \fB\-\-window\fR \fI<WINDOW_SEL>\fR
Act on this window instead of the focused one
.SS "yabai window focus"
.PP
\fByabai window focus\fR [\fIWINDOW_SEL\fR] 
.PP
Focus a window [default: the acting window]
.SS "yabai window close"
.PP
\fByabai window close\fR [\fIWINDOW_SEL\fR] 
.PP
Close a window [default: the acting window]
.SS "yabai window minimize"
.PP
\fByabai window minimize\fR [\fIWINDOW_SEL\fR] 
.PP
Minimize a window [default: the acting window]
.SS "yabai window deminimize"
.PP
\fByabai window deminimize\fR <\fIWINDOW_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Deminimize a window
.SS "yabai window send-to-display"
.PP
\fByabai window send\-to\-display\fR <\fIDISPLAY_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Send the acting window to the visible space of a display
.SS "yabai window send-to-space"
.PP
\fByabai window send\-to\-space\fR <\fISPACE_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Send the acting window to a space
.SS "yabai window swap"
.PP
\fByabai window swap\fR <\fIWINDOW_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Swap the acting window with another tiled window
.SS "yabai window warp"
.PP
\fByabai window warp\fR <\fIWINDOW_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Split the node of another tiled window and put the acting window in it
.SS "yabai window stack"
.PP
\fByabai window stack\fR <\fIWINDOW_SEL\fR> 
.PP
Stack another window onto the node of the acting window
