\fB\-\-grid\fR \fI<ROWS:COLUMNS:X:Y:WIDTH:HEIGHT>\fR
Place the floating window on a grid of the display
.TP
\fB\-\-scratchpad\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Make the window the scratchpad NAME; it floats from then on
.SS "yabai rule apply"
.PP
\fByabai rule apply\fR [\fB\-\-label\fR] [\fB\-\-app\fR] [\fB\-\-app\-not\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-title\-not\fR] [\fB\-\-role\fR] [\fB\-\-role\-not\fR] [\fB\-\-subrole\fR] [\fB\-\-subrole\-not\fR] [\fB\-\-display\fR] [\fB\-\-space\fR] [\fB\-\-follow\fR] [\fB\-\-manage\fR] [\fB\-\-sticky\fR] [\fB\-\-mouse\-follows\-focus\fR] [\fB\-\-sub\-layer\fR] [\fB\-\-opacity\fR] [\fB\-\-native\-fullscreen\fR] [\fB\-\-grid\fR] [\fB\-\-scratchpad\fR] [\fIRULE\fR] 
