.SS "yabai signal"
.PP
Add, remove or list the shell commands run after events
.SS "yabai signal add"
.PP
\fByabai signal add\fR [\fB\-\-label\fR] [\fB\-\-app\fR] [\fB\-\-app\-not\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-title\-not\fR] [\fB\-\-active\fR] <\fB\-\-action\fR> <\fIEVENT\fR> 
.PP
Run a shell command (through /usr/bin/env sh \-c) after every EVENT
.PP
.TP
\fB\-\-action\fR \fI<SHELL_COMMAND>\fR
The shell command to run; the YABAI_* variables of the event are in its environment
.TP
\fB\-\-label\fR \fI<LABEL>\fR
A later signal with the same label replaces this one
.TP
\fB\-\-app\fR \fI<REGEX>\fR
Only for windows or applications whose application name matches REGEX
.TP
\fB\-\-app\-not\fR \fI<REGEX>\fR
Only for windows or applications whose application name does not match REGEX
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<REGEX>\fR
Only for windows whose title matches REGEX
.TP
\fB\-\-title\-not\fR \fI<REGEX>\fR
Only for windows whose title does not match REGEX
.TP
\fB\-\-active\fR \fI<ACTIVE>\fR
Only when the window or application is the focused one (on) or is not (off)
.br
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on
.IP \(bu 2
off
.RE
.TP
<\fIEVENT\fR>
The event that runs the action
.br
.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
application\-launched: An application launched; sets YABAI_PROCESS_ID; filtered by \-\-app
.IP \(bu 2
application\-terminated: An application quit; sets YABAI_PROCESS_ID; filtered by \-\-app and \-\-active
.IP \(bu 2
application\-front\-switched: Another application came to the front; sets YABAI_PROCESS_ID and YABAI_RECENT_PROCESS_ID
.IP \(bu 2
application\-activated: An application was activated; sets YABAI_PROCESS_ID; filtered by \-\-app
.IP \(bu 2
application\-deactivated: An application was deactivated; sets YABAI_PROCESS_ID; filtered by \-\-app
.IP \(bu 2
application\-visible: An application was unhidden; sets YABAI_PROCESS_ID; filtered by \-\-app
.IP \(bu 2
application\-hidden: An application was hidden; sets YABAI_PROCESS_ID; filtered by \-\-app and \-\-active
.IP \(bu 2
window\-created: A window opened, also when its application launched; sets YABAI_WINDOW_ID; filtered by \-\-app and \-\-title
.IP \(bu 2
window\-destroyed: A window closed, also when its application quit; sets YABAI_WINDOW_ID; filtered by \-\-app and \-\-active
.IP \(bu 2
window\-focused: A window became the key window; sets YABAI_WINDOW_ID; filtered by \-\-app and \-\-title
.IP \(bu 2
window\-moved: A window moved; sets YABAI_WINDOW_ID; filtered by \-\-app, \-\-title and \-\-active
.IP \(bu 2
window\-resized: A window changed size; sets YABAI_WINDOW_ID; filtered by \-\-app, \-\-title and \-\-active
.IP \(bu 2
window\-minimized: A window was minimized; sets YABAI_WINDOW_ID; filtered by \-\-app, \-\-title and \-\-active
.IP \(bu 2
window\-deminimized: A window was deminimized; sets YABAI_WINDOW_ID; filtered by \-\-app and \-\-title
.IP \(bu 2
window\-title\-changed: A window changed its title; sets YABAI_WINDOW_ID; filtered by \-\-app, \-\-title and \-\-active
.IP \(bu 2
space\-created: A space was created; sets YABAI_SPACE_ID and YABAI_SPACE_INDEX
.IP \(bu 2
space\-destroyed: A space was destroyed; sets YABAI_SPACE_ID
.IP \(bu 2
space\-changed: Another space became active; sets YABAI_SPACE_ID, YABAI_SPACE_INDEX, YABAI_RECENT_SPACE_ID and YABAI_RECENT_SPACE_INDEX
.IP \(bu 2
