.IP \(bu 2
display\-removed: A display was disconnected; sets YABAI_DISPLAY_ID
.IP \(bu 2
display\-moved: The display arrangement changed; sets YABAI_DISPLAY_ID and YABAI_DISPLAY_INDEX
.IP \(bu 2
display\-resized: A display changed resolution; sets YABAI_DISPLAY_ID and YABAI_DISPLAY_INDEX
.IP \(bu 2
display\-changed: Another display became active; sets YABAI_DISPLAY_ID, YABAI_DISPLAY_INDEX, YABAI_RECENT_DISPLAY_ID and YABAI_RECENT_DISPLAY_INDEX
.IP \(bu 2
mission\-control\-enter: Mission control opened; sets YABAI_MISSION_CONTROL_MODE
.IP \(bu 2
